.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "thenify-all"
.PP
\fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP \fR\fP [][license-url] \fR\fP \fR\fP

.PP
Promisifies all the selected functions in an object\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
var thenifyAll = require('thenify\-all');

var fs = thenifyAll(require('fs'), {}, [
  'readFile',
  'writeFile',
]);

fs\&.readFile(__filename)\&.then(function (buffer) {
  console\&.log(buffer\&.toString());
});
.fi
.PP
.SH "API"
.PP
.SS "var obj = thenifyAll(source, [obj], [methods])"
Promisifies all the selected functions in an object\&.

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRsource\fP - the source object for the async functions
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRobj\fP - the destination to set all the promisified methods
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRmethods\fP - an array of method names of \fRsource\fP
.PP
.SS "var obj = thenifyAll\&.withCallback(source, [obj], [methods])"
Promisifies all the selected functions in an object and backward compatible with callback\&.

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRsource\fP - the source object for the async functions
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRobj\fP - the destination to set all the promisified methods
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRmethods\fP - an array of method names of \fRsource\fP
.PP
.SS "thenifyAll\&.thenify"
Exports \fRthenify\fP this package uses\&. 
